      {
        "id": 124656,
        "name": "lutherbellhendricksv",
        "username": "lutherbellhendricksv",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lutherbellhendricksv/{size}/2350_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-12-30T13:19:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>\"Impossible attacks\": Being out of line of sight, out of an attack's Area, or violating another restriction of an attack (like Melee) all make an attack impossible in this context.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Slip into Shadows triggers before the attack of Drawn to the Flame, but after the Push.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Hypersonic Assault is unique in that it makes a multi-target attack with a different Origin for each target. Slip into Shadows will probably make that attack impossible because all of Tachyon's attacks are Melee.</p>",
