        "created_at": "2014-12-30T14:44:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hypersonic attacks targets on spaces Tachyon just passed through.</p><p>Once Wraith leaves one of those hexes she is no longer a valid target, and the attack is impossible.</p><p>Apparently Wraith can dodge faster than the the speed of sound.</p>",
