      {
        "id": 124658,
        "name": "payprplayn",
        "username": "payprplayn",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/b2d939/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-12-31T02:42:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Interesting. &nbsp;The text of Hypersonic Assault never actually says which hexes the attacks are made from (and kind of implies that they are made from the ending hex, since it says she moves and then makes an attack against each enemy she passed through). &nbsp;My intuition suggested basically the behavior you described, but I'm not sure everybodies would. &nbsp;I wonder if Spiff would consider adding this to the FAQ for that power.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
