        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-12-31T14:37:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The attack happens on the hex the enemy character was on (consider Range as 0 as if Tachyon was making the attack on the same hex as the enemy). Once Wraith leaves that Hex with Slip, the attack cannot be made because it is essentially still a melee attack.</p>",
